    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'multipleLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: OOOOUUuuugghh.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'multipleLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: The Docs are holdin out meds for me sayin I've already had enough...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'multipleLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: This pain is too much to bear...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'multipleLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: 'Hey, say you grab me those drugs on the counter and I''ll give you
        this rock. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'multipleLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: I know its just a rock but its the only thing I've got on me right now.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'multipleLines.Array.data[5]'
      value: Please I can't keep goin on like this...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'completedLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Thanks, heres that rock.
